<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-nile.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Uganda · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Uganda Family Adventure</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>6 days</b></span>
        <span>Jinja · Lake Mburo · Entebbe</span>
        <span>Mothers &amp; children</span>
        <span>from <b>$4,600</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Uganda%20Family%20Adventure" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="uganda.html">Uganda</a> / Uganda Family Adventure</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">A gentler mix of wildlife and water, paced for families — the source of the mighty Nile at Jinja, boat and walking safaris at Lake Mburo, and a moving morning with rescued chimpanzees on an island sanctuary.</p>
        <p>Short distances, plenty of activity and lodges with room to roam. (Gorilla and chimp forest treks have a minimum age of 15, so this journey keeps younger children happily in the thick of it instead.)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 6-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Entebbe</h3><p>Met at the airport and taken to a family-friendly lake-shore hotel with gardens and a pool to unwind after the flight.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Entebbe lake hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Jinja &amp; the source of the Nile</h3><p>Drive to Jinja, the adventure capital, where the Nile begins its long journey north. A gentle family boat trip to the source, plus optional quad biking or a calm-water float.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Jinja river lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To Lake Mburo</h3><p>A scenic drive south-west, crossing the equator (a fun photo stop and science lesson) to Lake Mburo National Park.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Mburo lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lake Mburo safari</h3><p>A boat safari for hippo and birds, plus a guided nature walk among zebra, giraffe and impala — Mburo is one of the few parks where walking with wildlife is allowed.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Mburo lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return &amp; Ngamba chimps</h3><p>Back to Entebbe, then a boat to Ngamba Island sanctuary to meet rescued chimpanzees from the viewing platform — an unforgettable hour for all ages.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Entebbe lake hotel · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Farewell</h3><p>A relaxed morning by the lake, then transfer to the airport for your onward flight — full hearts and full memory cards.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Family lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Uganda%20Family%20Adventure"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Jinja river lodge</h3><p>Gardens above the Nile, with family rooms.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Uganda%20Family%20Adventure"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Mihingo Lodge</h3><p>Rock-kopje lodge overlooking Lake Mburo.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Uganda%20Family%20Adventure"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Entebbe lake hotel</h3><p>Pool, gardens and an easy airport hop.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Private transfers throughout</li>
          <li>Family-friendly lodges &amp; rooms</li>
          <li>Jinja Nile boat trip</li>
          <li>Lake Mburo boat safari &amp; nature walk</li>
