          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Equator crossing &amp; all park fees</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$4,600 per person sharing</strong>; child rates available. International flights and visas are extra. Suitable year-round; the drier months are easiest for families.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>An adventure for all ages.</h2><p>Tell us your children's ages and we'll shape the perfect family pace.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Uganda%20Family%20Adventure" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
